# ALLOWLIST. A build tree (tools/setup.sh <dir>) holds the ROM and everything made from it; none of it belongs here.
# Only source, scripts and docs are tracked -- everything else is ignored by the leading "*" and has to be
# re-included explicitly below.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!README_MIYOO.md
!decomp.patch
!hh/
!hh/**
!miyoo/
!miyoo/**
!tools/
!tools/*.sh
*.z64
*.n64
*.v64
*.bin
*.zip
*.log
__pycache__/
